<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>剧本杀 · 援助金疑案</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #f4f6f9;
            color: #2b303a;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', Roboto, system-ui, sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 14px;
            left: 14px;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dcdfe6;
            color: #2b303a;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.15s;
            line-height: 1;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        .menu-toggle:hover {
            background: #f0f2f5;
        }
        .sidebar {
            width: 200px;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 28px 14px;
            border-right: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            height: 100vh;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            overflow-y: auto;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .sidebar h2 {
            color: #718096;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            padding-bottom: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .sidebar a {
            display: block;
            color: #4a5568;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-left: 3px solid transparent;
        }
        .sidebar a:hover:not(.locked) {
            background: #edf2f7;
            color: #1a202c;
        }
        .sidebar a.active {
            background: #ebf8ff;
            color: #2b6cb0;
            border-left-color: #3182ce;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .sidebar a.locked {
            color: #a0aec0;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        .sidebar a.locked:hover {
            background: none;
            color: #a0aec0;
        }
        .sidebar a.locked::after {
            content: ' 🔒';
            font-size: 0.7rem;
        }
        .sidebar .back-btn {
            margin-top: auto;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            padding-top: 16px;
            color: #718096;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .sidebar .back-btn:hover {
            color: #2b6cb0;
            background: #f7fafc;
        }
        .main {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 32px 36px 50px;
            max-width: 920px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }
        .page {
            display: block;
            animation: fade 0.25s ease;
        }
        .page.hidden {
            display: none;
        }
        @keyframes fade {
            0% { opacity: 0.3; }
            100% { opacity: 1; }
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #1a202c;
            border-left: 4px solid #3182ce;
            padding-left: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }
        .desc {
            color: #4a5568;
            background: #f7fafc;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-left: 4px solid #4a5568;
        }
        .home-title {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px 40px;
        }
        .home-title h1 {
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            border-left: none;
            padding-left: 0;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            color: #2d3748;
        }
        .home-title .sub {
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
        .home-title .divider {
            width: 60px;
            height: 2px;
            background: #cbd5e0;
            margin: 20px auto;
        }
        .home-start {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .home-start .btn {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            padding: 14px 50px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #3182ce;
            border: none;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
            background: #2b6cb0;
        }
        .btn:active:not(:disabled) {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: #3182ce;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
            background: #2b6cb0;
        }
        .btn-success {
            background: #2f855a;
        }
        .btn-success:hover:not(:disabled) {
            background: #276749;
        }
        .input-area {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px 16px;
            align-items: center;
            background: #f7fafc;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            margin: 12px 0 16px;
        }
        .input-area label {
            color: #4a5568;
            font-weight: 500;
            min-width: 60px;
        }
        .input-area input {
            flex: 1 1 160px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e0;
            color: #2d3748;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.15s;
        }
        .input-area input:focus {
            border-color: #3182ce;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(49, 130, 206, 0.15);
        }
        .input-area input::placeholder {
            color: #a0aec0;
        }
        .input-area .hint {
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }
        .identity-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin: 8px 0 12px;
        }
        .identity-badge.good {
            background: #ebf8ff;
            color: #2b6cb0;
            border: 1px solid #bee3f8;
        }
        .identity-badge.bad {
            background: #fff5f5;
            color: #c53030;
            border: 1px solid #fed7d7;
        }
        .identity-badge.accomplice {
            background: #fffff0;
            color: #b7791f;
            border: 1px solid #fefcbf;
        }
        .script-box {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #2d3748;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin: 10px 0 20px;
            max-height: 520px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .error-msg {
            color: #e53e3e;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .scene-container {
            position: relative;
            background: #edf2f7;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin: 16px 0 24px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e0;
        }
        .scene {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
            background: #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 70%, #edf2f7, #cbd5e0);
            min-height: 280px;
        }
        .body-figure {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 10%;
            left: 35%;
            width: 22%;
            aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.2;
            background: #a0aec0;
            border-radius: 40% 40% 10% 10% / 60% 60% 20% 20%;
            transform: rotate(12deg);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .body-figure::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 20%;
            width: 30%;
            height: 30%;
            background: #cbd5e0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px #718096;
        }
        .body-figure::after {
            content: '✕';
            position: absolute;
            top: 6%;
            left: 48%;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #e53e3e;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            opacity: 0.5;
        }
        .blood-smear {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 22%;
            left: 48%;
            width: 6%;
            height: 4%;
            background: #e53e3e;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(2px);
            opacity: 0.3;
        }
        .hotspot {
            position: absolute;
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #3182ce;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #3182ce;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            z-index: 10;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .hotspot:hover:not(.revealed) {
            background: #3182ce;
            color: #ffffff;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }
        .hotspot.revealed {
            background: #e2e8f0;
            border-color: #a0aec0;
            color: #718096;
            cursor: default;
        }
        .clue-panel {
            background: #f7fafc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 18px 24px;
            margin-top: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-left: 4px solid #3182ce;
            min-height: 70px;
        }
        .clue-panel strong {
            color: #2b6cb0;
        }
        .lock-area {
            background: #f7fafc;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }
        .lock-area input {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #cbd5e0;
            color: #2d3748;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            width: 180px;
            text-align: center;
            outline: none;
            font-family: monospace;
        }
        .lock-area input:focus {
            border-color: #3182ce;
        }
        .clue-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 16px 0 20px;
        }
        .clue-btn {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e0;
            color: #4a5568;
            padding: 14px 8px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .clue-btn:hover:not(.revealed) {
            background: #ebf8ff;
            border-color: #3182ce;
            color: #2b6cb0;
        }
        .clue-btn.revealed {
            background: #edf2f7;
            border-color: #cbd5e0;
            color: #a0aec0;
            cursor: default;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            text-align: center;
            color: #a0aec0;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .menu-toggle { display: block; }
            .sidebar {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                z-index: 999;
                transform: translateX(-110%);
                width: 220px;
                height: 100vh;
                box-shadow: 4px 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            }
            .sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }
            .main { padding: 60px 16px 30px; }
            h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; padding-left: 12px; }
            .home-title h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            .input-area { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
            .lock-area input { width: 150px; font-size: 1.3rem; }
            .home-start .btn { font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 12px 36px; }
            .clue-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
            .hotspot { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 0.7rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- 汉堡菜单 -->
    <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle">☰</button>

    <!-- 左侧目录 -->
    <div class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
        <h2>📁 目录</h2>
        <a class="active" data-page="page-home">🏠 首页</a>
        <a data-page="page-role" id="navRole">🎭 1. 你的角色名字</a>
        <a data-page="page-studentid" id="navStudentId" class="locked">🔑 2. 你的学号</a>
        <a data-page="page-clue1" id="navClue1" class="locked">🔍 3. 第一轮线索</a>
        <a data-page="page-lock" id="navLock" class="locked">🔐 4. 第二轮密码</a>
        <a data-page="page-clue2" id="navClue2" class="locked">📂 5. 第二轮线索</a>
        <div class="back-btn" id="backBtn">← 返回首页</div>
    </div>

    <!-- 主内容 -->
    <div class="main" id="mainContent">

        <!-- 首页 -->
        <div class="page" id="page-home">
            <div class="home-title">
                <h1>剧本杀</h1>
                <div class="divider"></div>
                <h1 style="font-size:2.8rem; border-left:none; padding-left:0;">援助金</h1>
                <div class="sub">— 校园推理 · 悬疑案件 —</div>
            </div>
            <div class="home-start">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="startBtn">▶ 开始游戏</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 1. 你的角色名字 -->
        <div class="page hidden" id="page-role">
            <h1>🎭 1. 你的角色名字</h1>
            <div class="desc">输入你的角色名（如：张三、李四），进行身份匹配。</div>
            <div class="input-area">
                <label for="roleInput">👤 角色名：</label>
                <input type="text" id="roleInput" placeholder="请输入你的角色">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="confirmRoleBtn">确认身份</button>
            </div>
            <div id="roleError" class="error-msg"></div>
            <div id="identityDisplay"></div>
            <div class="script-box" id="scriptPreview">等待确认角色身份...</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. 你的学号 -->
        <div class="page hidden" id="page-studentid">
            <h1>🔑 2. 你的学号</h1>
            <div class="desc">输入你的学号（4位数字），解锁阵营信息与完整剧本。</div>
            <div class="input-area">
                <label for="studentIdInput">🔑 学号：</label>
                <input type="password" id="studentIdInput" placeholder="请输入学号" maxlength="4">
                <button class="btn btn-success" id="confirmIdBtn">查看剧本</button>
                <span class="hint">学号在角色卡背面</span>
            </div>
            <div id="idError" class="error-msg"></div>
            <div id="fullIdentityDisplay"></div>
            <div class="script-box" id="scriptFull">请先在第1步确认角色身份，然后输入正确的学号解锁角色资料与阵营。</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. 第一轮线索 -->
        <div class="page hidden" id="page-clue1">
            <h1>🔍 3. 第一轮线索</h1>
            <div class="desc">点击场景中的数字标记，获取线索。</div>
            <div class="scene-container">
                <div class="scene">
                    <div class="body-figure"></div>
                    <div class="blood-smear"></div>
                    <div class="hotspot" style="top:12%; left:18%;" data-clue="A1">1</div>
                    <div class="hotspot" style="top:8%; right:22%;" data-clue="A2">2</div>
                    <div class="hotspot" style="bottom:28%; left:8%;" data-clue="A3">3</div>
                    <div class="hotspot" style="bottom:18%; right:10%;" data-clue="A4">4</div>
                    <div class="hotspot" style="top:45%; left:55%;" data-clue="A5">5</div>
                    <div class="hotspot" style="top:70%; right:25%;" data-clue="A6">6</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="clue-panel" id="clue1Panel">
                <strong>📌 线索区</strong><br>
                <span style="color:#a0aec0;">点击场景中的数字获取线索</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. 第二轮密码 -->
        <div class="page hidden" id="page-lock">
            <h1>🔐 4. 第二轮密码</h1>
            <div class="desc">输入四位数字密码（0610），解锁第二轮线索。</div>
            <div class="lock-area">
                <input type="password" id="lockInput" maxlength="4" placeholder="· · · ·">
                <br><br>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="unlockBtn">解锁</button>
                <div id="lockError" class="error-msg" style="margin-top:12px;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. 第二轮线索 -->
        <div class="page hidden" id="page-clue2">
            <h1>📂 5. 第二轮线索</h1>
            <div class="desc">点击编号查看对应线索内容。</div>
            <div class="clue-grid">
                <div class="clue-btn" data-clue="B1">B1</div>
                <div class="clue-btn" data-clue="B2">B2</div>
                <div class="clue-btn" data-clue="B3">B3</div>
                <div class="clue-btn" data-clue="B4">B4</div>
                <div class="clue-btn" data-clue="B5">B5</div>
                <div class="clue-btn" data-clue="B6">B6</div>
            </div>
            <div class="clue-panel" id="clue2Panel">
                <strong>📌 线索区</strong><br>
                <span style="color:#a0aec0;">点击上方编号查看线索详情</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">主办：kjiaaaaa</div>
    </div>

    <script>
        var roleData = {
            '张三': {
                title: '班级委员',
                studentId: '1457',
                identity: '好人',
                identityClass: 'good',
                script: '你的公开身份：平时负责班级事务。性格认真。和林予安认识，但不算特别亲近。\n\n你的秘密：两周前，老师让你帮忙整理过学生资料。你发现援助金名单似乎有一处错误。你当时没有仔细追查。后来这件事情就不了了之。\n\n你知道：林予安最近似乎一直在调查什么。他曾经问过你："如果学校的记录是错的，你会不会告诉老师？"你当时回答："当然会。"但实际上你没有那么确定。\n\n你的目标：\n1. 找出谁杀了林予安。\n2. 弄清楚援助金到底发生了什么。\n3. 不要让别人误以为你参与了偷钱。'
            },
            '李四': {
                title: '体育生',
                studentId: '1776',
                identity: '好人',
                identityClass: 'good',
                script: '你的公开身份：性格直接。和林予安曾经发生过争吵。\n\n你的秘密：案发当天晚上，你确实回过旧教学楼。你去拿落下的东西。你不想承认，因为你害怕自己成为嫌疑人。\n\n你知道：你大约20:15经过三楼。当时最后一间教室里有人说话。但你没有进去。\n\n你的目标：\n1. 找出凶手。\n2. 证明自己没有进入案发教室。'
            },
            '小温': {
                title: '学生会成员',
                studentId: '7654',
                identity: '好人',
                identityClass: 'good',
                script: '你的公开身份：对学校事务比较熟悉。\n\n你的秘密：你知道学校最近有一笔援助金出现问题。你曾经听老师讨论过："有一份申请资料不太对。"你没有告诉其他同学。\n\n你知道：林予安曾经问过你："学生会有没有人能看到援助金的资料？"你回答没有。但实际上，你知道谁有权限。\n\n你的目标：\n1. 查清楚援助金被谁动过。'
            },
            '李华': {
                title: '成绩优秀的学生',
                studentId: '9825',
